{"id":"n62908-2-7","stage":1,"title":"가슴 · 胸前","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62908-2-7-1","ko":"가슴에 달린 게 뭐니?","zh":"你胸前挂的是什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가슴에","meaning":"胸前","explanation":"가슴：胸前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"가슴","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62908","senseId":"2","lemma":"가슴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달린","meaning":"挂着","explanation":"달리다：挂着；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"달리다","audio":"/audio/605b9178b6748898219d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61300","senseId":"1","lemma":"달리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐니?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1bfa2a79f54c02d8","term":"가슴","zh":"胸前","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3","entryId":"62908","definition":"遮盖人脖子和肚子之间身体前面部分的衣服的一部分。","pronunciation":["가슴"]},{"id":"605b9178b6748898","term":"달리다","zh":"挂着","audio":"/audio/605b9178b6748898219d.mp3","entryId":"61300","definition":"某物品挂在或拴在一定地方。","pronunciation":["달리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/200881c6440cdc2ea17a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62908-2-7-2","ko":"응, 우리 학교 배지